<title>BELGIUM: Ostend airport says Jan-June cargo traffic up 4.6p.</title>
<headline>Ostend airport says Jan-June cargo traffic up 4.6p.</headline>
<dateline>OSTEND 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ostend airport recorded a 4.61 percent growth in air cargo traffic for the first half of the year, compared to the same 1996 period, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The airport's cargo volumes rose to 48,040 tonnes in January-June 1997 from 45,992 tonnes. Aircraft movements increased by 4.19 percent to 19,600 while passengers reached 54,578 against 40,397.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
